{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"103574","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/103574","key":"MC-220067","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"18/Mar/21 12:18 PM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"Thebug\"></a>The bug</h3>\n<p>When a command block is full of characters that take more than 1 byte to store, the chunk that command block is in gets corrupted.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Howtoreproduce\"></a>How to reproduce</h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Place a command block down.</li>\n\t<li>Copy and paste this symbol \"■\" into the command block until the command block is full.</li>\n\t<li>Save and quit to title.</li>\n\t<li>Get back in the world.<br>\n→ <img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/error.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"> The chunk the command block was in is re-generated; resetting everything in it</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"Note\"></a>Note</h3>\n<p>■ is not the only character this works with.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Gameoutputerrormessage\"></a>Game output error message</h3>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">Failed to store chunk [7, 1]\njava.io.UTFDataFormatException: encoded string (■■■■■■■■...■■■■■■■■) too <span class=\"code-object\">long</span>: 97500 bytes\n\tat java.base/java.io.DataOutputStream.writeUTF(DataOutputStream.java:368)\n\tat java.base/java.io.DataOutputStream.writeUTF(DataOutputStream.java:332)\n\tat nq.a(SourceFile:65)\n\tat na.a(SourceFile:415)\n\tat na.a(SourceFile:104)\n\tat ng.a(SourceFile:81)\n\tat na.a(SourceFile:415)\n\tat na.a(SourceFile:104)\n\tat na.a(SourceFile:415)\n\tat na.a(SourceFile:104)\n\tat nk.a(SourceFile:95)\n\tat nk.a(SourceFile:83)\n\tat cnq.a(SourceFile:70)\n\tat cnm.a(SourceFile:153)\n\tat cnm.a(SourceFile:143)\n\tat ara$b.run(SourceFile:61)\n\tat aqy.g(SourceFile:91)\n\tat aqy.a(SourceFile:146)\n\tat aqy.run(SourceFile:102)\n\tat java.base/java.util.concurrent.ThreadPoolExecutor.runWorker(ThreadPoolExecutor.java:1130)\n\tat java.base/java.util.concurrent.ThreadPoolExecutor$Worker.run(ThreadPoolExecutor.java:630)\n\tat java.base/java.lang.<span class=\"code-object\">Thread</span>.run(<span class=\"code-object\">Thread</span>.java:831)\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Video\"></a>Video</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/C4t2avl0Dhw\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://youtu.be/C4t2avl0Dhw</a><br>\n(Video by Phoenix SC)</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"20/Mar/21 6:33 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/135231","id":"135231","filename":"chunkfail.txt","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2bf89af0fdd92ce25290c17873c786fe?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FA-4.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2bf89af0fdd92ce25290c17873c786fe?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FA-4.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2bf89af0fdd92ce25290c17873c786fe?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FA-4.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2bf89af0fdd92ce25290c17873c786fe?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FA-4.png"},"displayName":"ampolive","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"13/Jul/21 8:17 AM","size":"33 kB","mimeType":"text/plain","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/135231"},{"sel